         feedback_onboarding_teaches_core_gesture.md — NOT the advanced
         long-press-for-Settings gesture. Settings discovery is a second-order
         concern solved by the Tray honeycomb and accidental long-presses. -->
    <string name="combos_longpress_onboarding_hint">Tip: Hold grip and push the joystick to start a combo</string>

